{
  "name": "vector_light_door_handover",
  "saveFile": "minimal_colony.rws",
  "description": "WHY THE EXISTING FILM CANNOT SEE THIS. vector_light_door_aperture.json films the same swing and is the right scene for it, but BOTH of its arms set vector_light_door_glow_blocker false -- it predates the flag being on by default. So it has never had vanilla's grid moving in it at all, and the grid moving is the entire subject here.",
